{"id":44187,"date":"2025-08-29T07:51:31","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T06:51:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=44187"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:40:45","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:40:45","slug":"trail-noturno-valongo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-noturno-valongo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Noturno Valongo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Noturno Valongo 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Trail Noturno Valongo 2026<\/strong> (TNV) convida-te a desafiar as serras do concelho de <strong>Valongo<\/strong>, no distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>, sob a atmosfera m\u00e1gica da noite de dezembro. Com trilhos t\u00e9cnicos iluminados pela luz do frontal e balizados com refletores, o evento oferece uma experi\u00eancia sensorial \u00fanica entre a vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o e o relevo caracter\u00edstico do Parque das Serras do Porto.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento integra o <strong>Trail Longo (21 km)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto (13 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong>, integrando pontua\u00e7\u00f5es para o Circuito de Trilhos de Valongo. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta da <strong>KeMedo Team ADN<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Valongo<\/strong> garante abastecimentos de semi-autonomia de excel\u00eancia, seguran\u00e7a permanente e o lend\u00e1rio conv\u00edvio final com caldo verde, bifana e pastel de nata.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 19:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255,